# CROSS-PLATFORM TESTING PROTOCOL: INFINITY PROTOCOL v6.2

## 1. THE GOLDEN TRIANGLE — Required Test Targets
| Device | Browser | Viewport | Priority |
|---|---|---|---|
| iPhone 15 Pro | Safari (iOS latest) | 393×852 | P0 |
| Samsung Galaxy S23 | Chrome Android | 360×780 | P0 |
| iPad Pro 12.9" | Safari | 1024×1366 | P1 |
| MacBook 13" | Chrome + Safari | 1280×800 | P0 |
| Low-bandwidth sim | Chrome (throttled 3G) | 375×667 | P1 |

## 2. PLAYWRIGHT MOBILE CONFIGS
```typescript
// playwright.config.ts — required device matrix
export default defineConfig({
  projects: [
    { name: 'chromium-desktop', use: { ...devices['Desktop Chrome'] } },
    { name: 'safari-desktop',   use: { ...devices['Desktop Safari'] } },
    { name: 'mobile-ios',       use: { ...devices['iPhone 15 Pro'] } },
    { name: 'mobile-android',   use: { ...devices['Pixel 7'] } },
  ],
});
```

## 3. REQUIRED CHECKS PER VIEWPORT
- [ ] Touch targets ≥ 44×44pt — `await expect(el).toHaveCSS('min-height', '44px')`
- [ ] Landscape orientation renders correctly
- [ ] Dark Mode: `page.emulateMedia({ colorScheme: 'dark' })` — verify all text legible
- [ ] Safe area insets: no content clipped on notched devices
- [ ] No horizontal scroll at any breakpoint

## 4. NATIVE — MAESTRO FLOWS
For React Native / Expo apps:
```yaml
# Maestro flow — smoke test on iOS + Android
- launchApp
- assertVisible: "Welcome"
- tapOn: "Sign In"
- assertVisible: "Dashboard"
```
Run via: `maestro test flows/smoke.yaml` as part of every PR check.
